sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UG as User Gateway
    participant UC as User Controller
    participant US as User Service
    participant UR as User Repo
    participant ST as Object Storage (e.g., S3/GCS)
    participant IM as Image Processor (thumb/validate)
    participant DB as Database

    %% A) Update profile fields
    U->>UG: PATCH /users/me {name}
    UG->>UC: forward
    UC->>US: updateProfile(userId,{name})
    US->>UR: update(userId,{name})
    UR->>DB: UPDATE users SET name=? WHERE id=?
    DB-->>UR: ok
    UR-->>US: user{ id,email,name,avatar }
    US-->>UC: 200 user
    UC-->>UG: 200
    UG-->>U: updated profile

    %% B) Avatar upload via presigned URL
    U->>UG: POST /users/me/avatar/initiate {contentType,imageSize}
    UG->>UC: forward
    UC->>US: initiateAvatarUpload(userId, contentType, size)
    US->>IM: validate(contentType,size,max=5MB, types=[png,jpg,webp])
    IM-->>US: ok
    US->>ST: createUploadUrl(key="avatars/{userId}/{uuid}.png", contentType)
    ST-->>US: {uploadUrl, publicUrl, key}
    US-->>UC: 200 {uploadUrl, publicUrl}
    UC-->>UG: 200
    UG-->>U: uploadUrl

    %% Client uploads directly to storage
    U->>ST: PUT {file bytes} (to uploadUrl)
    ST-->>U: 200

    %% C) Confirm avatar and persist URL
    U->>UG: POST /users/me/avatar/confirm {publicUrl}
    UG->>UC: forward
    UC->>US: confirmAvatar(userId, publicUrl)
    US->>IM: probe(publicUrl)  %% optional: fetch-head/scan
    IM-->>US: ok
    US->>UR: update(userId,{avatar:publicUrl})
    UR->>DB: UPDATE users SET avatar=? WHERE id=?
    DB-->>UR: ok
    UR-->>US: user{avatar}
    US-->>UC: 200 {avatar:publicUrl}
    UC-->>UG: 200
    UG-->>U: avatar set
